$ heat run --help
usage: heat run [--nx value] [--cfl value] [--verbose]... [--help] [--markdown] [--version]

Run a simulation

Optional switches:
  --nx value
      default value 64
      Cells along each direction
  --cfl value
      default value 0.25
      CFL number
  --verbose, -v
      default value 0
      Verbosity (repeatable)
  --help, -h
      Print this help message
  --markdown, -md
      Save this help message in a Markdown file
  --version
      Print version
